                    "eyebrow": "",
                    "heading": "Our Values",
                    "paragraphs": [
                        "At Hartup Construction, we are committed to integrity, professionalism, employee wellbeing,",
                        "flexibility, and building lasting relationships.",
                        "We foster a family-oriented culture where our people, clients, subcontractors,",
                        "and suppliers are valued, and we strive to maintain these principles as we continue to grow.",
                        "At Hartup Construction, we pride ourselves on building lasting relationships through professionalism, transparency, and exceptional results.",
                        "Our goal is to provide clients with dependable construction solutions that enhance the quality, usability, and value of every property we work on."
                    ],
                    "bullets": [
                        "Quality craftsmanship in every detail, from foundation to finish",
                        "Integrity and transparency in all quoting, communication, and delivery",
                        "Client focus — your vision, timeline, and budget always come first",
                        "Safety and compliance as non-negotiable standards on every project"
                    ],
