                    "text_size": "normal",
                    "eyebrow_size": "sm",
                    "eyebrow": "",
                    "heading": "New section heading",
                    "paragraphs": [
                        "A 1-bedroom granny flat is a self-contained secondary dwelling that typically includes",
                        "a bedroom, bathroom/laundry, kitchen, and living area. It is commonly built on the",
                        "same property as the main house and can serve a variety of residential or investment purposes.",
                        "Key Functions of a 1-Bedroom Granny Flat",
                        "1. Independent Living Space",
                        "Ideal for elderly parents wanting to stay close to family while maintaining independence.",
                        "Suitable for adult children, relatives, or guests needing separate accommodation.",
                        "2. Rental Accommodation",
                        "Can be leased to singles, couples, retirees, students, workers, bed & breakfast accommodation.",
                        "Providing a source of ongoing passive income.",
                        "3. Home Office or Business Space",
                        "Can be used as a private office, consulting room, studio, or workspace separate from the",
                        "main residence.",
                        "4. Guest Accommodation",
                        "Offers comfortable, private accommodation for extended family or visiting friends."
                    ],
